{"id":"2c485321de","t":"طارد الارواح كيوشي","c":"cv","n":38,"l":40,"s":["ss"],"k":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi"},"u":1795595599357,"desc":"يدور قصة \"طارد الارواح كيوشي\" عن كيوشي، أقوى طارد أرواح في التاريخ، والذي بلغ ذروة القوة المطلقة من أجل حماية كل ما هو عزيز على قلبه، إلا أنه يحمل سراً خفياً لا يستطيع الإفصاح عنه لأحد. تجتمع عناصر الملحمة في هذه السلسلة الكوميدية والدرامية الجديدة لقتالات طرد الأرواح، حيث يتوجب على البطل أن يغدو سيفاً يبيد الشر ودرعاً حصيناً يحمي الضعفاء.","type":"","status":"مستمر","genres":[],"src":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi"},"chapters":{"1":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-1"},"2":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-2"},"3":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-3"},"4":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-4"},"5":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-5"},"6":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-6"},"7":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-7"},"8":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-8"},"9":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-9"},"10":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-10"},"11":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-11"},"12":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-12"},"13":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-13"},"14":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-14"},"15":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-15"},"16":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-16"},"17":{"ss":"ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi|/read/ultimate-exorcist-kiyoshi/chapter-17"},"18":{"ss":"ultimate-exorci